{"id":2087,"level":79,"name":"Відкритий напад (1)","group":"Атака на короля","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>The discovered attack is one of the most important and common chess tricks. The trick can occur the moment you have two pieces on the same line (file, rank or diagonal). As soon as you move the piece in front, the piece behind (a rook, bishop or queen) can suddenly get free sight, allowing you to attack several enemy pieces at the same time.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?&nbsp;</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material by means of a discovered attack</span></p>  <p></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":92,"examples":[{"fen":"2k5/pp3p2/2p5/2n5/3q4/3B4/PPK5/1N1R4 w - - 0 30","pgn":"{[%evp 0,3,373,387,699,725]} 30. Bf5+ {[%csl Rc8,Gd1,Rd4,Gf5]} Kc7 31. Rxd4 * ","text":"<p>У білих є виграшний відкритий шах за допомогою <strong>1.Bf5+!</strong>, після чого чорний ферзь зникає з дошки.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r1r3k1/ppp2pp1/1n5p/1N6/4b1P1/P3B2P/BP3P2/4R1K1 w - - 0 25","pgn":"{[%evp 0,3,84,77,73,87]} 25. Bxb6 {[%csl Gb6,Ge1,Re4][%cal Ge1e4]} axb6 26. Rxe4 * ","text":"<p>Усуваючи коня на b6, білі починають атаку на чорного слона. Білі виграють дві фігури лише за одну, чудова угода!</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77718,"fen":"4qr1k/pp4b1/7p/2p1N1p1/5nP1/7P/PP5Q/3RR2K w - - 0 37","pgn":"{[%csl Re8][%evp 0,3,169,187,237,263]} {Q=1} 37. Nd7 Qf7 {Q=2} 38. Nxf8 * ","format":27,"texts":["фігури на одній лінії пропонують тактичні можливості.","Книжка матеріальної вигоди."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77733,"fen":"rnb1kb1r/pp3ppp/8/1p1q4/4N3/8/PPPPQPPP/R1B1K2R w KQkq - 0 11","pgn":"{[%csl Re8][%evp 0,3,1557,1567,1566,935]} {Q=1} 11. Nf6+ Kd8 12. Nxd5 (12. Qe8+ Kc7 13. Nxd5+) * ","format":27,"texts":["If the white knight moves, black is in check. Choose the best discovered attack."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77725,"fen":"r2q1k2/pb2b3/1p1pp2p/5p2/3P1p2/3B3P/PP1NQPrN/4RR1K b - - 0 20","pgn":"{[%csl Rh1][%evp 0,3,-432,-463,-481,-466]} {Q=1} 20... Rxf2+ 21. Nhf3 Rxe2 (21... Bxf3+) * ","format":27,"texts":["If the black rook moves, then white is in check."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77729,"fen":"r1bqkb1r/pp5p/2n1pp2/3p2pn/3P3B/3BPN2/PP3PPP/RN1QK2R w KQkq - 0 10","pgn":"{[%csl Rh5][%evp 0,3,201,209,285,268]} {Q=1} 10. Nxg5 fxg5 11. Qxh5+ * ","format":27,"texts":["The black knight on h5 is hanging."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77719,"fen":"r4b2/1pk5/2p1p1p1/p3PpPp/2P2P2/PP1r3P/1K1B4/3R3R w - - 0 27","pgn":"{[%csl Rd3][%evp 0,3,232,281,287,273]} {Q=1} 27. Bxa5+ Rxa5 28. Rxd3 * ","format":27,"texts":["фігури на одній лінії пропонують тактичні можливості."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77721,"fen":"2kr1r2/ppq5/2p5/4p2p/3nN3/3Q1B2/PPP2RPP/4R1K1 b - - 0 22","pgn":"{[%csl Rd3][%evp 0,3,-124,-178,-189,-182]} {Q=1} 22... Nxf3+ 23. Rxf3 Rxd3 * ","format":27,"texts":["The black rook eyes over the knight and sees a white queen."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77724,"fen":"r1r3k1/4ppbp/3pbnp1/1N6/4P3/1P2BP2/P2RB1PP/R5K1 b - - 0 17","pgn":"{[%csl Ra1][%evp 0,3,-219,-199,-193,-199]} {Q=1} 17... Nxe4 18. fxe4 Bxa1 * ","format":27,"texts":["The white rook on a1 is hanging."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77720,"fen":"r1r3k1/5ppp/p7/1p1P2q1/2nB4/2Q2P1P/PP3P2/2R1RK2 b - - 0 22","pgn":"{[%csl Rc3][%evp 0,3,-644,-600,-609,-626]} {Q=1} 22... Nd2+ 23. Ke2 Rxc3 * ","format":27,"texts":["The black rook eyes the knight and spots a white queen!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77722,"fen":"rnbq1rk1/2p1ppbp/p2p1np1/1p6/3PPP2/2P2B2/PP1N2PP/R1BQK1NR w KQ - 0 8","pgn":"{[%csl Ra8][%evp 0,3,240,225,238,223]} {Q=1} 8. e5 dxe5 9. Bxa8 * ","format":27,"texts":["Open files for your pieces."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77731,"fen":"3q2nr/2r1k3/1Q2p3/p2pP1pp/8/P3P3/1P3PPP/R3K1NR b KQ - 0 20","pgn":"{[%csl Rb6][%evp 0,3,-314,-307,-303,-291]} {Q=1} 20... Rc1+ 21. Rxc1 Qxb6 * ","format":27,"texts":["The black queen looks over the rook and sees a white queen!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77730,"fen":"r2qk2r/1pp2pp1/p3p3/2b4p/2Bn4/2B2P2/PPP2QPP/2KR3R b kq - 0 14","pgn":"{[%csl Rf2][%evp 0,3,-211,-226,-234,-194]} {Q=1}  14... Nb3+ 15. axb3 Bxf2 (15... Qxd1+ 16. Rxd1 Bxf2) * ","format":27,"texts":["There is a lot of tension in this position. Calculate the impact of a discovered check."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]}]}